{
  "requirement": "Running `habeas setup` in an existing Cargo and mdBook project MUST add Habeas as a dev dependency, configure `habeas mdbook` as its preprocessor, add the badge stylesheet, and create `tests/habeas.rs` that calls `habeas::validate()`. Repeating setup MUST avoid duplicate configuration and MUST NOT overwrite a differing test or stylesheet. With `--install-skills`, setup MUST also install all bundled skills in `.agents/skills/` without overwriting differing files. Without the flag, setup MUST NOT change `.agents/skills/`. The flag MUST work together with `--path <crate-dir>`. The non-Symposium getting started instructions MUST recommend `habeas setup --install-skills` and explain where the skills are copied.",
